stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unlocated
    Unlocated --> Locating: open weather or apply settings
    Ready --> Locating: change location / explicit retry
    Ready --> Ready: automatic location cache younger than 15 minutes
    Locating --> Locating: new selection supersedes request
    Locating --> LookupError: invalid coordinates / no city / network error
    LookupError --> Locating: edit location or retry
    Locating --> Ready: explicit coordinates / city result / IP detection
    Ready --> Fetching: coordinates change / hourly refresh
    Fetching --> Ready: current-location weather response
    Fetching --> Ready: network failure retains last forecast
    note right of Locating
        Empty setting selects IP detection.
        Changing location clears old forecast.
        Superseded callbacks are ignored.
        Failures never restart lookup automatically.
    end note
